A||||21||Uaana||1st Fun Kill||||1||
Z||000000||Uaana||10-25-2001||10:16 PM||||Well I finally got my first really fun Kill!<BR>Stop light right before a highway really opens up, (no lights or entrances for the next 3 mi's) Anyways lined up next to a brand new Monte Carlo complete with backward wearing hat and pretty blonde girlfriend.<BR>I take of fairly mildly not expecting to race. I guess he hears my 3.4 rev up and decides to show me who the bigger dog is..<BR>Well I lay into it, quick shift into 2nd he gains a little. Then I make the jump to 3rd and just walk away.... I slow down a to make my turn at the next exit and see both the kid and GF staring out the right side...<BR>Poor kids probably gonna take it back and see why he got stomped by a plain looking 15 yo Fiero...<P>Ok I know people have raced bigger and faster but this one was fun because I keep remembering the commerical talking about the Big 200 hp motor in those things...||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroKyle||10-25-2001||11:08 PM||||Hey uh, my mom has a 2001 Monte SS, and that sucker hauls. Did you race an SS or LS? Theres a pretty big difference. I raced ours while my dad was driving it, and he beat me every time. The trick is to stick it into 1st or 2nd then take the traction control off. If you can get on it without spinning the front tires, he'll win every time. I have an 85 GT 4 speed manual. Raced a 95' 5.0 with the SS, ran side by side with it. No differnce whatsoever, (I got him by a nose though).<BR>Otherwise a kill is a kill, pretty good one too. Stupidass kid didn't know how to drive. Don't make fun of him though. They are really nice cars (the SS) and uh I cruise around with my girlfriend on the Fiero's day off. Hat backwards not included.<BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroKyle||10-25-2001||11:10 PM||||Wait, you said 3.4? What do you have in your car? HP wise too? Whats the 3.4 outta too. I'd like to know.<P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0PgAgVMwT!1W9RUb20vChbvv6QaE!2K1LWrFB6SxTnTchZgvIygv7Y3YwXpVdD8GeNkWpurYfoQxvNRK6j6kEmOFLoIHavbIr/Kyle-85-GT.jpg">    <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
Z||000003||Flamberge||10-26-2001||12:03 AM||||Great story!! I try not to race (since my car is old and an engine rebuilt is not in my near future) but sometimes I can't resist the urge to chase down MR-2s and then eat them for lunch. Was the 3.4 hard to get into your Fiero? Did you do it yourself?<P>Oh, and I lost to a Saab the other day. I stopped trying after 60 mph, since we were in town and he was already probably going 75.<P>"Sometimes you get the bear, and sometimes the bear gets you." - Garfield<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||12
Z||000004||AgaricX||10-26-2001||12:44 AM||||I'm not too impressed with Monte Carlo SS's.  I have a Mazda 929 as well as my Fiero.  3L V6, Cold air, Dual Exhaust.  I have taken down 2 Monte Carlo SS's, both shiny-new.  Gotta love RWD and 17's.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||10-26-2001||01:12 AM||||sweeeet man!  I take it all (or most) of the bugs are worked out and you're having some fun before we get 8 feet of snow, huh?  <P>We gotta get another minnesota meet together soon!  The weather is gonna get bad quick<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000006||BlackStang95||10-26-2001||01:25 AM||||Um, theres barely a difference at all between the LS and SS.  Namely 20hp and 20 lbs of torque.  That's tenths of a second. 0-60 is in the high 7's i believe.<P>Sweet kill man, nothin beats backwards hat kills.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by BlackStang95 (edited 10-26-2001).]||||reg||1
