Z||000009||rogergarrison||10-26-2001||07:07 AM||||one of those new SS's tried to beat me on I-70, he disappeared behind me like Bin Ladin in a cave.<P>on a sidenote, anyone know what the idea of backwards hat is anyway. I though it was to keep the sun off their redneck, but they do it indoors and at nite too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> or are they just that dumb?<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 10-26-2001).]||||reg||1
